    "created_at": "2023-01-16T20:56:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-16T20:56:26Z",
    "body": "The docs should probably be expanded a bit, but are you aware of the [palette](https://starship.rs/config/#prompt) feature?\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# Set 'foo' as custom color palette\r\npalette = 'foo'\r\n\r\n# Define custom colors\r\n[palettes.foo]\r\n# Overwrite existing color\r\nblue = '21'\r\n# Define new color\r\nmustard = '#af8700'\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
