    "body": "This looks exactly like what I was looking for, thanks @davidkna !\r\n\r\nI saw the `Pallette` in the code, but it wasn't clear to me how to use that feature - I also noticed that even if pallette wasn't already present, my proposed code would have been bad anyways.\r\n\r\nCould we convert this into a \"documentation [bug?]\" ticket instead to add a section dedicated to Palette and/or \"Custom Colors\" to provide an apropos for others like me :sweat_smile: ",
